(Approved: xx)
A record of a legally convened meeting of the Council of the Village of
Winnetka, which was held at Council Chambers on Tuesday, October 11, 2022, at
7:00 PM.
1)   Call to Order.
President Rintz called the meeting to order at 7:00 PM. Village Manager Bahan
called the roll of the Village Council. Present: Trustees Rob Apatoff, Andy
Cripe, Bob Dearborn, Kim Handler, and John Swierk. Absent: Trustee Tina Dalman.
Also present: Assistant Village Manager Kristin Kazenas, Village Attorney Ben
Schuster, Deputy Village Clerk Berina Gradjan, Community Development Director
David Schoon, and 0 persons in the audience.
