for the Purpose of Discussing Personnel Pursuant to Section 2(c)(1) of the Open
Meetings Act.
Trustee Dearborn, seconded by Trustee Dalman, moved to adjourn to Closed
Session for the Purpose of Personnel Pursuant to Section 2(c)(1) of the Open
