1)   Call to Order.
President Rintz called the meeting to order at 7:00 PM. Village Manager Rob
Bahan called the roll. Present: Trustees Rob Apatoff, Tina Dalman, Robert
Dearborn, Kim Handler, and Bridget Orsic. Absent: Trustee Kirk Albinson. Also
present: Deputy Village Clerk Berina Gradjan, Assistant Village Manager Kristin
Kazenas, Village Attorney Ben Schuster, Community Development Director David
Schoon and approximately 63 persons in the audience.
