success of the 4th of July festivities.
 
a)   Village President.
   i.   President Rintz commends the Park District and Village staff for their
participation in the 4th of July parade. Furthermore, President Rintz, on
behalf of the Village, sends his condolences to the Laidley family after the
tragic incident on July 4th.
 
1)   Establishment of the Consent Agenda.
Trustee Orsic, seconded by Trustee Apatoff, moved to approve the Establishment
of the Consent Agenda. By voice vote, the motion carried.
 
