7:00 PM.
1)   Call to Order.
President Rintz called the meeting to order at 7:01 PM. Village Manager Rob
Bahan called the roll. Present: Trustees Rob Apatoff, Tina Dalman, Robert
Dearborn, and Bridget Orsic. Absent: Trustees Kirk Albinson and Kim Handler.
Also present: Deputy Village Clerk Berina Gradjan, Assistant Village Manager
Kristin Kazenas, Village Attorney Peter Friedman, Community Development
Director David Schoon, and approximately 16 persons in the audience.
