a)   August 8, 2023 Study Session Cancelled.
b)   August 15 Regular Meeting All of the Council members present said they
expect to attend with the exception of Trustee Bridget Orsic.
c)   September 5, 2023 Regular Meeting All of the Council members present said
they expect to attend.
4)   Public Comment.
i.   Pete Foset addresses Council regarding lakefront matters.
ii.   Ted Wynnychenko addresses Council regarding concerns pertaining to the
Bertling-Hill-Woodland pathway vacation.
iii.   Susan Schreiber addresses Council regarding rip currents and e. coli.
iv.   Christina Codo urges Council to conduct a joint study session with the
Winnetka Park District and addresses Council regarding beach protection.
