SPECIAL MEETING
                                               (Approved: March 5, 2024)
 
A record of a legally convened Special Meeting of the Council of the Village of
Winnetka, which was held in the Second Floor Conference Room on Tuesday,
February 6, 2024, at 6:30 PM.
1)   Call to Order. 
Village President Chris Rintz called the meeting to order at 6:30 p.m. Present:
Trustees Robert Apatoff, Kirk Albinson, Robert Dearborn, Kim Handler, and
Bridget Orsic. Absent: Trustees Rob Apatoff and Tina Dalman. Also Present:
Village Manager Robert M. Bahan, Assistant Village Manager Kristin Kazenas,
Village Attorney Peter Friedman, and 1 person in the audience.
Trustee Apatoff arrived at 6:31 p.m.
2)   Public Comment.
i.    Ted Wynnychenko addresses Council regarding the release of closed session
minutes.
3)   Closed Session
for the Purpose of Discussing Probable or Imminent or Pending Litigation
Pursuant to Section 2(c)(11) of the Open Meetings of the Open Meetings Act.
 
