i.   February 6, 2024 Special Closed Session
ii.   February 6, 2024 Regular Meeting
b)    Approval of Warrant List Dated February 9, 2024 – February 22, 2024 in
the amount of $1,345,795.01.
c)    Resolution No. R-21-2024: Approving an Extension Agreement for
