President Rintz called the meeting to order at 7:00 PM. Village Manager Rob
Bahan called the roll. Present: Trustees Kirk Albinson, Rob Apatoff, Robert
Dearborn, Kim Handler, and Bridget Orsic. Absent: Trustee Tina
Dalman. Also present: Assistant Village Manager Kristin Kazenas, Deputy Village
