and immediately upon the conclusion of the Closed Session without the conduct
of any further business or comments. By roll call vote, the motion
carried. Ayes: Trustees Albinson, Apatoff, Dalman, Dearborn, and Handler. Nays:
 None. Absent: Trustee Orsic.
The Council adjourned into Closed Session at 8:08 p.m.
