any further business or comments. By roll call vote, the motion carried. Ayes:
Trustees Albinson, Dalman, Dearborn, and Handler. Nays: None. Absent: Trustees
Apatoff and Orsic.
The Council adjourned into Closed Session at 7:13 p.m.
