f)   Appoint Stephen Dewart to a full term on the Police Pension Board of
Trustees. (Stephen is filling a current vacancy) – his term will expire on May
1, 2027.
Trustee Dalman seconded by Trustee Apatoff, moved to appoint, and re-appoint,
the said chairperson, commissioners, and members to their respective boards as
set forth by appointments a – f, by omnibus vote.
