President Dearborn advises that Council will be approving the Contract with
DiMeo Brothers, Inc. to repair the elder storm sewer outlet and that the
Village and Park District have been collaborating on necessary actions to
reopen the beaches. The Village will complete the repairs needed in a timely
and coordinated manner once the Park District has a contractor for their
portion of the work.
7)   Approval of the Consent Agenda
