ORDINANCE NO. M-537-98
AN ORDINANCE OF THE VILLAGE OF WINNETKA, COOK COUNTY, ILLINOIS, TO APPROVE THE
ADMISSION OF THE VILLAGE OF ALLENDALE, THE CITY OF FAIRFIELD AND THE CITY OF
MCLEANSBORO AS NEW MEMBERS OF THE ILLINOIS MUNICIPAL ELECTRIC AGENCY AND TO
AUTHORIZE EXECUTION OF A SUPPLEMENT TO THE AGENCY AGREEMENT ESTABLISHING THE
ILLINOIS MUNICIPAL ELECTRIC AGENCY
   WHEREAS, the Village of Winnetka, Cook County, Illinois, is a member of the
Illinois Municipal Electric Agency ("IMEA"); and
   WHEREAS, the Village of Allendale, Wabash County, Illinois, City of
Fairfield, Wayne County, Illinois, and the City of McLeansboro, Hamilton
County, Illinois ("Allendale, Fairfield and McLeansboro") desire to become
members of the Illinois Municipal Electric Agency; and
   WHEREAS, Allendale, Fairfield and McLeansboro have complied with all
conditions for membership, has adopted the Agency Agreement and has paid all
fees; and
   WHEREAS, the Board of Directors of the Illinois Municipal Electric Agency
has by Ordinance approved the Supplement to its Agency Agreement which will
cause Allendale, Fairfield and McLeansboro to become members of the Agency.
   NOW, THEREFORE, the Council of the Village of Winnetka do ordain:
   SECTION 1:   The findings and determinations set forth in the preamble to
this Ordinance are hereby made findings and determinations of the Council of
the Village of Winnetka and are hereby incorporated into the text of this
ordinance by this reference.
   SECTION 2:   The Village of Allendale, Wabash County, Illinois, the City of
Fairfield, Wayne County, Illinois and the City of McLeansboro, Hamilton County,
Illinois are hereby approved as new members of the Illinois Municipal Electric
Agency.
   SECTION 3:   The Council of the Village of Winnetka hereby approve the terms
and conditions of the Illinois Municipal Electric Agency's Agreement and the
Supplement to the Agency Agreement, which is attached hereto as Exhibit No. 1.
   SECTION 4:   The President and Village Clerk are hereby authorized and
directed to execute and attest, respectively, the Supplement to the Agency
Agreement, substantially in the same form attached hereto as Exhibit No. 1, for
the admission of the new members of the Illinois Municipal Electric Agency.
   SECTION 5:   That this Ordinance shall be in full force and effect from and
after its passage, approval, and posting.
   Passed and approved this 15th day of September, 1998.
   AYES:      Trustees Derning, Duhl, Hilton, Meuer, Lien and Lanphier
   NAYS:   None
   ABSENT:   None
