   SECTION 3: That there is hereby certified to the County Clerk of Cook
County, Illinois, the several sums above, constituting said total amount, and
the total amount of Nine Million, Seven Hundred Three Thousand, Three Hundred
Ten Dollars ($9,703,310), and that on or before the time required by law, the
Village Clerk shall file a certified copy hereof with the County Clerk of the
County of Cook, Illinois, and it shall be the duty of said County Clerk to levy
taxes for the year 2000 on all properties subject to taxation within the
Village of Winnetka in accordance with the provisions hereof.
   SECTION 4: That this Ordinance shall be in full force and effect from and
after its passage, approval, and posting.
