ORDINANCE NO. M-27-2002
AN ORDINANCE PROVIDING FOR THE ADDITION OF TOWER ROAD, FROM THE WESTERN VILLAGE
CORPORATE LIMITS TO THE EAST EDGE OF THE PAVEMENT OF VERNON AVENUE, TO THE
MUNICIPAL STREET SYSTEM OF THE VILLAGE OF WINNETKA, COOK COUNTY, ILLINOIS
   WHEREAS, on October 17, 2000, the Council of the Village of Winnetka
(“Village Council”) authorized staff to sign a letter of intent for the
transfer of jurisdiction, from the State of Illinois to the Village of
Winnetka, of that portion of Tower Road extending from the western corporate
limits of the Village to the east edge of the pavement of Vernon Avenue; and
   WHEREAS, as part of the letter of intent, the State of Illinois, acting
through the Illinois Department of Transportation, agreed to assume a portion
of the costs of rehabilitating that portion of Tower Road prior to the transfer
of jurisdiction; and
   WHEREAS, the rehabilitation of Tower Road is substantially complete; and
   WHEREAS, the Village of Winnetka and the State of Illinois, under date of
September 3, 2002, have now entered into an agreement for the transfer of
jurisdiction of a part of Tower Road, from the western corporate limits of the
Village to the east edge of the pavement of Vernon Avenue, to the Municipal
Street System of the Village of Winnetka.
   NOW, THEREFORE, the Council of the Village of Winnetka do ordain as follows:
   SECTION 1 : That the foregoing recitals are hereby incorporated as the
findings of the Council of the Village of Winnetka, as if fully set forth
herein.
   SECTION 2:  That Tower Road, from the western corporate limits of the
Village to the east edge of the pavement of Vernon Avenue, be added to the
Municipal Street System of the Village of Winnetka.
   SECTION 3: That the Village Clerk is directed to forward a certified copy of
this Ordinance to the State of Illinois, through it District Engineer’s office
at 201 West Center Court, Schaumburg, Illinois.
   SECTION 4: That this Ordinance shall take effect immediately upon passage,
approval and posting.
   ADOPTED this 17th day of September, 2002, pursuant to the following roll
call vote:
