   SECTION 3: That there is hereby certified to the County Clerk of Cook
County, Illinois, the several sums above, constituting said total amount, and
the total amount Ten Million Seven Hundred Forty One Thousand Two Hundred
Fifteen Dollars ($10,741,215), and that on or before the time required by law,
the Village Clerk shall file a certified copy hereof with the County Clerk of
