promises to pay to the Registered Owner identified above, or registered assigns
as hereinafter provided, on the Maturity Date identified above, the Principal
Amount identified above and to pay interest (computed on the basis of a 360-day
year of twelve 30-day months) on such Principal Amount from the Dated Date of
