SUPPLEMENT NUMBER 14
TO THE AGENCY AGREEMENT FORMING
THE ILLINOIS MUNICIPAL ELECTRIC AGENCY
This document is a Supplement to the Agency Agreement, dated as of May 16,
1984, as amended, between and among the municipalities of the State of Illinois
listed therein and as Supplemented thereafter from time to time ("Agency
Agreement"), which established the Illinois Municipal Electric Agency.
This Supplement shall serve as a republication and readoption of all of the
terms and conditions of the Agency Agreement as it applies to Members of the
Agency on the date that the Village of Winnetka, Cook County, Illinois executes
this Supplement.
This Supplement is the Agreement between and among the member municipalities of
the Illinois Municipal Electric Agency and the Village of Albany, the Village
of Allendale, the City of Batavia, the City of Geneseo, the City of Geneva, the
City of McLeansboro, the City of Rochelle, the Village of Riverton and the City
of Springfield which approves the withdrawal of Albany, Allendale, Batavia,
Geneseo, Geneva, McLeansboro, Rochelle, Riverton and Springfield from
membership in the Illinois Municipal Electric Agency.
The Village of Albany, the Village of Allendale, the City of Batavia, the City
of Geneseo, the City of Geneva, the City of McLeansboro, the City of Rochelle,
the Village of Riverton and the City of Springfield are hereby removed as
Members of the Illinois Municipal Electric Agency. This Supplement reflects
that each such municipality has met all conditions necessary for approval of
their withdrawal as Members of the Illinois Municipal Electric Agency as
follows:
1.   The Village of Albany, the Village of Allendale, the City of Batavia, the
City of Geneseo, the City of Geneva, the City of McLeansboro, the City of
Rochelle, the Village of Riverton and the City of Springfield have agreed to
withdraw as Members of the Illinois Municipal Electric Agency effective
December 31, 2006; and
2.   The Village of Albany, the Village of Allendale, the City of Batavia, the
City of Geneseo, the City of Geneva, the City of McLeansboro, the City of
Rochelle, the Village of Riverton and the City of Springfield have each adopted
this Supplement to the Agency Agreement or a Supplement to the Agency Agreement
substantially similar to this Supplement by Ordinance and each such
municipality has executed said Supplement; and
3.   The Village of Albany, the Village of Allendale, the City of Batavia, the
City of Geneseo, the City of Geneva, the City of McLeansboro, the City of
Rochelle, the Village of Riverton and the City of Springfield have each
complied with the conditions for withdrawal from membership in the Illinois
Municipal Electric Agency as established by the Act and the Bylaws of the
Agency.
This Supplement amends the Agency Agreement in the following manner:
On the face page of the Agency Agreement: delete the following municipalities
from the list of member municipalities contained thereon:
City of Batavia, Kane County
City of Geneseo, Henry County
City of Geneva, Kane County
City of McLeansboro, Hamilton County
City of Rochelle, Ogle County
City of Springfield, Sangamon County
Village of Albany, Whiteside County
Village of Allendale, Wabash County
Village of Riverton, Sangamon County
On the first page of the Agency Agreement following the face page: delete the
same municipalities from the list of member municipalities contained thereon.
On the third page of the Agency Agreement following the face page: delete the
reference to each such municipality and the name, business address and home
address of their initial director on the Board of Directors of the Illinois
Municipal Electric Agency from Section 2.1.
This Supplement becomes effective as to the Illinois Municipal Electric Agency,
all member municipalities of the Agency and the Village of Albany, the Village
of Allendale, the City of Batavia, the City of Geneseo, the City of Geneva, the
City of McLeansboro, the City of Rochelle, the Village of Riverton and the City
of Springfield upon the latter of December 31, 2006 or the approval by the
Corporate Authorities of a majority of the member municipalities of the Agency.
IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the undersigned, as the authorized representatives of the
municipality named below, have executed this Supplement to the Agency Agreement
as of the _____ day of ______________, 2006, in counterpart copies, each of
which shall constitute an original copy but all of which together shall
constitute one and the same instrument.
VILLAGE OF WINNETKA,
COOK COUNTY, ILLINOIS
