($20,795.00); and
WHEREAS, the total term of repayment of the project costs for Special Service
Area No. 4 is five years and the 2012 Tax Levy is for Year Two of Five; and
WHEREAS, the Village Council have determined that the total amount to be raised
by the levy of taxes on taxable property within Special Service Area No. 4 for
providing such Special Services for the fiscal year beginning April 1, 2012,
and ending March 31, 2013 is Four Thousand Eight Hundred Twenty-Four Dollars
