EXHIBIT B
WINNETKA ZONING BOARD OF APPEALS
EXCERPT OF MEETING MINUTES
JULY 10, 2017
Zoning Board Members Present:      Joni Johnson, Chairperson
Matthew Bradley
Sarah Balassa
E. Gene Greable
Thomas Kehoe
Carl Lane
Zoning Board Member Absent:      Mark Naumann
Village Attorney:            Peter Friedman
               Ben Schuster
