Chairperson Johnson stated that it would be a 4 foot x 10 foot pool.
Mr. Naumann asked Ms. Klaassen if there were any cases which were synonymous
with this one that they can refer to in terms of context or precedent.
Ms. Klaassen responded that she cannot recall one for a variation request. She
stated that you see these types of developments on the lakefront but that they
