Mr. Lane stated that is the whole point of having a 50 foot setback.
Ms. Balassa stated that the applicants have her extreme sympathy but that with
regard to precedent and everything it is going to push, she referred to new
construction and not renovation.
Mrs. Santi stated that she could answer the questions raised by the Board.
Chairperson Johnson stated that after the discussion, the applicants would be
