   WHEREAS, Hristo Hristov ( "Applicant" ) is the record title owner of the
property commonly known as 800 Tower Road in the Village ( “Subject Property” )
   WHEREAS, the Applicant desires to construct on the Subject Property: (i) a
second floor addition to the Building; and (ii) and a one-car detached garage
located in the rear yard adjacent to, and south of, the Building (collectively,
“Proposed Improvements” ); and
   WHEREAS, Ordinance No. M-1-2018, adopted by the Village Council on
______________, 2018 ( "Ordinance" ), grants variations from the provisions of
the Winnetka Zoning Ordinance to the Applicant to permit the construction of
the Proposed Improvements on the Subject Property with: (i) a roofed lot
coverage of 2,117.89 square feet; (ii) a front lot coverage of 698.36 square
feet; (iii) a front yard setback of 30.25 feet; and (iv) a detached garage rear
yard setback along the south side of the Subject Property of two feet; and
   WHEREAS, Section 8 of the Ordinance provides, among other things, that the
