LOT 2 AND LOT 3 (EXCEPT THE SOUTH 9.8 FEET THEREOF) IN BLOCK 1 IN MANUS INDIAN
HILL A SUBDIVISION OF THE NORTHWEST 1/4 OF THE WEST 1/2 OF THE NORTHEAST 1/4 OF
SECTION 28, TOWNSHIP 42 NORTH, RANGE 13 EAST OF THE THIRD PRINCIPAL MERIDIAN,
IN COOK COUNTY, ILLINOIS.
Commonly known as 67 Brier Street, Winnetka, Illinois.
