   WHEREAS, the Subject Property is improved with a two story, single-family
residence (“Existing Building”); and
   WHEREAS, the Applicant desires to improve the Subject Property by: (i)
demolishing the existing family room on the southwest corner of the Existing
Building; (ii) constructing a one-story addition on the southern face of the
Existing Building; (iii) converting the existing garage into a first floor
study; (iv) constructing an expanded master bedroom and bathroom on the
southwest corner of the second floor of the Existing Building; and (v)
constructing a one-story, two-car attached garage on the western side of the
Existing Building (collectively, “Proposed Improvements” ); and
   WHEREAS, to permit the construction of the Proposed Improvements, the
Applicant filed an application for variations from Sections 17.30.040 and
17.30.060 of the Zoning Ordinance to permit the construction of the Proposed
Improvement on the Subject Property (collectively, “Variations”); and
   WHEREAS, Ordinance No. M-01-2021, adopted by the Village Council on January
__, 2021 ( "Ordinance" ), grants the Variations; and
   WHEREAS, Section 8 of the Ordinance provides, among other things, that the
Ordinance will be of no force or effect unless and until the Applicant has
filed, within 60 days following the passage of the Ordinance, its unconditional
agreement and consent to accept and abide by each and all of the terms,
conditions, and limitations set forth in the Ordinance;
