ENTITLEMENT TIMELINE
March 21 - Village Council Preliminary PD Approval – Ordinance Introduction
 
April 2 – Village Council Preliminary PD Approval – Ordinance Adoption (if
required)
 
Summer - Village Council Final PD Approval.
CONSTRUCTION TIMELINE
August 2024
Submit for Demo & Foundation Permit.
September 2024
Submit for Building Permit.
October 2024
Contractor mobilization. Assumes an 8-10-week Village review of demo/foundation
permit.
Demolition begins; duration ~2 months.
*Development Team will work with Village to minimize impact on East Elm Street
District during holiday shopping season.
January 2025
Foundation/podium work begins; duration ~5 months.
Receive full building permit. Assumes a 12-week Village review of building
permit.
May 2025
Vertical construction begins; duration ~8 months.
December 2025
Interior buildout begins; duration ~7.5 months.
May 2026
Public Improvements begin; duration ~2.5 months.
*Development Team will work with Village to minimize impact on Winnetka Music
Festival. Village acknowledges that Elm Street and Lincoln Avenue adjacent to
the Property will be closed for construction during the festival.
July 2026
Substantial Completion.
