right-of-way, as shown in Gages Second Addition to Lakeside Subdivision,
recorded September 19, 1874 as Document Number 191481, a subdivision in the
East Half of the Northwest Quarter of Section 17, Township 42 North, Range 13
East of the Third Principal Meridian, in Cook County, Illinois.
 
Commonly known as 1065 Gage Street, Winnetka, Illinois.
 
