ORDINANCE NO. MC-9-2001
AN ORDINANCE AMENDING SECTION 5.08.130 OF CHAPTER 5.08 OF THE WINNETKA VILLAGE
CODE PERTAINING TO LIQUOR LICENSES
THE COUNCIL OF THE VILLAGE OF WINNETKA do ordain:
SECTION 1: That Subsection B of Section 5.08.130 of Chapter 5.08 of the
Winnetka Village Code, "Alcoholic Beverages," be amended to provide as follows:
Section 5.08.130   Numbers Of Licenses
   The maximum number of licenses to be issued in each class shall be as
follows, provided, however, that the number in any class shall be reduced by
one for each such license that expires or that is revoked, surrendered or not
renewed:
A. Class A                   4
B. Class A-1                 5
C. Class A-2                 1
D. Class B                   2
E. Special Class C           Unlimited
F. Class D                   0
G. Class D-1                 0
H. Class E                   2
I. Television Rider          1
J. Packaged Meal Rider       2
K. Sidewalk Restaurant Rider 2
 
SECTION 2: That this ordinance shall be in full force and effect from and after
its passage, approval and posting.
   Passed and approved this 4th day of September, 2001, by the Council of the
Village of Winnetka:
